On 11/4/10 7:23 AM, shadoooo wrote:

> Or: as RT11 boots, what could be a solution to dump the disk?

Write a RT11 program to read raw blocks through the WD0 driver
and dump it out using the TT driver using block handshaking and
checksumming with the system on the other end.

You need to be able to continue past blocks that couldn't be read
as well.

This would be a generally handy program to have, BTW.

You should be able to write it in MACRO-11 and test it out in SIMH.





