sides of the board), albeit very carefully with a magnifying
glass. But all the mechanical/solder/trace connections looked
good to me, and seemed unlikely to have gone bad during the
time I'd simply left the machine off. (Does, however, maybe add
another reason to take your advice about keeping machines on 24x7.:)

